  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Platform Types (Platform_Types)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Platform-specific fundamental data types (integers, booleans, floating-point numbers) mapped to CPU architecture primitives.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00026\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> boolean <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Platform_00026]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef unsigned char <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This standard AUTOSAR type shall only be used together with the definitions TRUE and FALSE.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
