   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef const void* <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Platform_91002\">ConstVoidPtr</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This standard AUTOSAR type shall be a void pointer to const. Note: This type shall be used for buffers that are passed to the callee.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00064\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> CPU_TYPE <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Platform_00064]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This symbol shall be defined as #define having one of the values CPU_TYPE_8, CPU_TYPE_16, CPU_TYPE_32 or CPU_TYPE_64 according to the platform.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00038\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> CPU_BIT_ORDER <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Platform_00038]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This symbol shall be defined as #define having one of the values MSB_FIRST or LSB_FIRST according to the platform.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00039\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> CPU_BYTE_ORDER <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Platform_00039]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This symbol shall be defined as #define having one of the values HIGH_BYTE_FIRST or LOW_ BYTE_FIRST according to the platform.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Platform_00056\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> TRUE_FALSE <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Platform_00056]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The symbols TRUE and FALSE shall be defined as follows: #ifndef TRUE #define TRUE 1 #endif #ifndef FALSE #define FALSE 0 #endif</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Standard Types (Std_Types)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Standard types, return codes (Std_ReturnType, E_OK, E_NOT_OK), version info structures, and error codes shared across the entire AUTOSAR architecture.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Std_00005\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Std_ReturnType <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Std_00005]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type can be used as standard API return type which is shared between the RTE and the BSW modules. It shall be defined as follows: typedef uint8 Std_ Return Type;</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Std_00015\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Std_VersionInfoType <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Std_00015]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">typedef struct {\n    <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> vendorID;\n    <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> moduleID;\n    <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> sw_major_version;\n    <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> sw_minor_version;\n    <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> sw_patch_version;\n} <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type shall be used to request the version of a BSW module using the <Module name>_ Get Version Info() function.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
